Test Name:
Does the RP Authentication Request's JWT contain a correct 'response_type' parameter
Description:
The Authentication request is taken, the JWT Token in the request parameter base64url decoded and the presence of the 'response_type' parameter is checked. This parameter's value must be the same of the 'response_types_supported' parameter in the OP metadata
Result:
not applicable
